Optional daily limit for segment emails, set in Configuration > Email Settings
> Segment Email Sending ("Segment emails per day", parameter
broadcast_daily_limit). When set, mautic:broadcasts:send sends at most that
many segment emails in any 24 hours, counted across all segment emails, and
the Send button in the email list is replaced by a notice, so sending happens
only on schedule. 0 keeps the stock behaviour.

